# Mobile Application Development Standards

- Design for thumb ergonomics: high-frequency actions within the bottom 40% of the viewport.
- Always handle system safe area insets (`SafeArea` in Flutter, `useSafeAreaInsets` in React Native).
- Optimize lists with virtualized or fast list renderers (`FlashList` or `ListView.builder`).
- Support hardware-accelerated 60/120fps gesture animations and haptic feedback.
